--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
6. Transfer 1000 CKB, account 0 -> account 1
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

$ offckb transfer ckt1...48ucew 1000 --privkey <REDACTED_DEVNET_KEY>
Successfully transfer, txHash: 0x1888f04bcdafc6e7f99be773abfcc68f816e92a3367016280aa1cd0268e4fdbc

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
7. Balances after
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

$ offckb balance ckt1...cytcyd8    # account 0, sender
CKB: 41998999.99999536

$ offckb balance ckt1...48ucew     # account 1, recipient
CKB: 42001000

--> sender lost 1000.00000464 CKB, recipient gained exactly 1000.
    the 464 shannon difference is the fee.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
8. Read the transaction back with my own TypeScript tool
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

$ cd exercises/transfer-ckb
$ npx tsc --noEmit          # clean, exit 0
$ npm run inspect

  see evidence/week-01-inspect-tx.log for the full output, and
  notes/transaction-anatomy.md for the field-by-field write-up.

